@startuml
title integration-python 异步提交与轮询（requirements v0.2）
participant "SpringBoot" as java
participant "PythonREST" as py
java -> py : POST submitJob
py --> java : 202 accepted + externalJobId
loop poll until terminal
  java -> py : GET status
  py --> java : running / succeeded / failed
end
java -> java : update PG task + file-metadata
@enduml
